<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint ComponentsAreExactlyTargetAndEnvironment: components->ControlFunctions::forAll { in c : Entity; c == targetSystem or environmentEntities->SequenceFunctions::includes(c) }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint EnvironmentEntitySetMatches: environment.entities->ControlFunctions::forAll { in e : Entity; environmentEntities->SequenceFunctions::includes(e) } and environmentEntities->ControlFunctions::forAll { in e : Entity; environment.entities->SequenceFunctions::includes(e) }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint EnvironmentMatchesTargetSystem: environment.system == targetSystem"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint OnlySERelations: systemEnvironmentRelations->ControlFunctions::forAll { in r : BinaryRelation; (r.source == targetSystem and environmentEntities->SequenceFunctions::includes(r.target)) or (r.target == targetSystem and environmentEntities->SequenceFunctions::includes(r.source)) }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint RelationsAreExactlySERelations: relations->ControlFunctions::forAll { in r : BinaryRelation; systemEnvironmentRelations->SequenceFunctions::includes(r) }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/coresense/cso> .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "extended system"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "ExtendedSystem"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#ExtendedSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An extended system is composed of a target system together with its selected environment and the relations between both of them."@en .
