<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#Functionality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint ExpectedPerformanceConsistent: expectedPerformance->ControlFunctions::forAll { in pm : PerformanceMeasure; pm.context.extendedSystem == context.extendedSystem and pm.object == object }"@en .
