<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://github.com/CoreSenseEU/ontology/blob/main/docs/CS-115_CS_Ontology.pdf> .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#sysmlKind> "occurrence def" .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#sysmlName> "CSBase::SystemState" .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint AllComponentsHaveState: entity.components->ControlFunctions::forAll { in c : Entity; componentStates->ControlFunctions::exists { in es : EntityState; es.entity == c } }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint AllRelationsHaveState: entity.relations->ControlFunctions::forAll { in r : BinaryRelation; relationStates->ControlFunctions::exists { in rs : BinaryRelationState; rs.relation == r } }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint AtMostOneStatePerComponent: componentStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in es1 : EntityState; componentStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in es2 : EntityState; es1 != es2 implies es1.entity != es2.entity } }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint AtMostOneStatePerRelation: relationStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in rs1 : BinaryRelationState; relationStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in rs2 : BinaryRelationState; rs1 != rs2 implies rs1.relation != rs2.relation } }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint ComponentBelongToSystem: componentStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in es : EntityState; entity.components->SequenceFunctions::includes(es.entity) }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint ComponentStatesAtSystemTime: componentStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in es : EntityState; es.timeInstant == timeInstant }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint RelationStatesAtSystemTime: relationStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in rs : BinaryRelationState; rs.timeInstant == timeInstant }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SysML constraint RelationsBelongToSystem: relationStates->ControlFunctions::forAll { in rs : BinaryRelationState; entity.relations->SequenceFunctions::includes(rs.relation) }"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/coresense/cso> .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "system state"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "SystemState"@en .
<http://w3id.org/coresense/cso#SystemState> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The state of a system at a time instant is the complete set of attribute values describing the current condition of its components and their relations."@en .
